      "text": "1 January. Early departure in 4x4 vehicles, Lexus or similar. The journey across the Altiplano and the Chilean border to San Pedro de Atacama takes approximately 8–9 hours. Transfer to the hotel on arrival. In the evening, an astronomical tour lasting 1.5–2 hours.\n\nAccommodation: Nayara Alto Atacama, Tilo Suite, breakfast (BB)",
